{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中環怡和大廈外牆有吊船疑故障下墮，兩名清潔工人一度被困半空其後獲救，輕傷送院，勞工處及置地公司正調查事件。 事發在昨傍晚6時16分，兩名工人被困於35樓及43樓圓形窗框，救援人員在大廈下方放置氣墊，另一邊廂消防員由天台游繩而下營救，至晚上7時42分，被困35樓工人率先由消防游繩吊至地面。晚上約8時06分，被困43樓工人則由消防救回天台安全地方。現場所見涉事吊船則在近地面位置。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060454/block/singleImage/3249372/df/01M5WZ70MAXCZD18RE9MXAMWMR.jpg?updatedAt=1793066726\"/><figcaption>(吳康琦攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060454/block/singleImage/3249374/df/01M5WZ7NT4QWYW1Z9CMMAXCD4W.jpg?updatedAt=1793066726\"/><figcaption>消防員游繩營救。(鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060454/block/singleImage/3249375/df/01M5WZ838Q8WXJTYWPXNVENWDM.jpg?updatedAt=1793066726\"/><figcaption>吊船在近地面位置。(吳康琦攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:14:04.619025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T21:18:18.714229+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:38.940791+00:00","content_hash":"c0398c9492bec3419494f1205af21b0f53d5343c04843fab6fa714bac7587664","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:14:04.619025+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}